From b519cf2da44437763451b268d4884efd6108dc78 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sysretq0 <sysretq0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:20:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] arm64: dts: mediatek: Add Advan X1 board device tree

Advan X1 smartphone (MT6789). Memory map from live stock /proc/iomem audit
(2026-11-11): one clean 3.64 GiB window, stock ramoops carveout declared as
memory+reserved, loader kernel-staging region declared. simplefb panel
console (1080x2460, stride 4352) and bootargs stub for the loki-loader LNXB
chain (rewrites bootargs in place, publishes initrd coordinates via the
linux,initrd-start/end stubs).

Change-Id: I278fd2d0bd6d69b859101320a1a050a902f862c3
Signed-off-by: sysretq0 <sysretq0@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/Makefile | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/Makefile
index a86fb313b..3dfbb4bb4 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/Makefile
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MEDIATEK) += mt2712-evb.dtb
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MEDIATEK) += mt6789-advan-x1.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MEDIATEK) += mt6755-evb.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MEDIATEK) += mt6779-evb.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MEDIATEK) += mt6795-evb.dtb
